==English==
{{was wotd|2018|May|3}}

===Etymology===
[[File:Ajedrez captura al paso del peon.png|thumb|An ''en passant'' capture in chess. When the white [[pawn#Noun|pawn]] moves from its starting position at square a2 to a4 (''first diagram''), the black pawn at b4 is able to capture the white pawn ''en passant''&nbsp;– as though it had moved only one square to a3 (''second and third diagrams'').]]

{{ubor|en|fr|en passant}}.

